# Maintainer-review candidate; no automatic Path B grade or points claim.
id:                     DRAFT-lutefisk-1.0.7-printf-embedded-nul-truncates-format
draft:                  true
trigger_tool:           conan|clang|make
phase:                  compilation
severity:               2
category:               correctness|printf|security-hardening
error_signature:        format string is not a string literal (potentially insecure) [-Wformat-security]|format string contains '\0' within the string body [-Wformat]
match_keywords:         printf, Wformat-security, embedded NUL, format string, sprintf, lutefisk, C89, sanitize
title:                  格式串里嵌 '\0' 会在 NUL 处截断，转换说明符根本不生效；把变量直接当格式串则是可被污染的格式串漏洞
root_cause:             两类老代码写法：(a) printf(变量) 直接把运行期字符串当格式串，clang 报 -Wformat-security，一旦字符串含 %n/%s 就会被内容格式化甚至写内存；(b) sprintf(p, "%d\0", n) 把 NUL 写进格式串字面量，C 标准规定格式串在首个 NUL 处结束，于是 %d 从未被求值，printf 打印的是垃圾。
affected_scope:         1990s-2010s 的 C 程序/科学计算工具里手写的 printf/sprintf 封装与进度输出；含中文/多字节注释或格式串拼接处尤甚
verification_cmd:       clang -fsyntax-only *.c 2>&1 | grep -E 'Wformat-security|contains .\\0.'; 用样本输入跑一次输出并与参考比对
rec_priority:           3
rec_approach:           pass-format-as-argument-and-strip-embedded-nul
rec_description:        printf(x) 一律改成 printf("%s", x)；格式串字面量里的嵌入 NUL 用 'x' 字符常量拼接而非 \0 终止；顺手把 sprintf(p, "\0") 这种空操作换成 *p = '\0'。改完重跑上游样本数据确认输出未变。
rec_command:            'grep -nE "printf\([a-zA-Z_]+\)|\\\\0\"" src/*.c | head -20'
rec_auto_fix:           false
principles:
causes:
caused_by:
similar_to:             lutefisk-1.0.7-lp64-implicit-int-math；同属老 C 科学计算程序的可移植性债，本条聚焦 printf 用法
